An unofficial community port that lets the Karpo Decision models run on Apple Silicon.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by MachinePulse or Google.

This software is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It works with, and takes its attention rule and function signatures from,
karpo-decision (https://github.com/machinepulse-ai/karpo-decision),
Copyright 2026 MachinePulse Pte. Ltd., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
karpo-decision is not included here; it is installed separately.
karpo_apple_silicon/mlx.py calls karpo-decision's encoder and block plan and re-expresses
its Gemma 4 layer computation for MLX.

No model weights are included. The Karpo Decision weights
(https://huggingface.co/MachinePulseAI) are Copyright 2026 MachinePulse Pte. Ltd. and
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. karpo-decision-31B and karpo-decision-12B
are modified versions of Gemma 4 (google/gemma-4-31B-it, google/gemma-4-12B-it), developed
by Google DeepMind and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Their own LICENSE
and NOTICE files apply to them and to anything converted from them.

Tested with karpo-decision 0.1.0 (commit 6600011eb5cf), torch 2.15.0, transformers 5.23.0, and for the MLX path
mlx 0.32.4 and mlx-lm 0.32.2.

